//api.github.com/users/Auralcat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auralcat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auralcat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auralcat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auralcat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auralcat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auralcat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-03-01T01:51:24Z","updated_at":"2020-03-01T01:52:43Z","body":"I could reproduce this issue and created a sample app for debugging, which is available here: https://github.com/Auralcat/rails-debug-app/tree/check-join-order-tables-issue-38597\r\n\r\nThe output for Rails 6.0.2.1 with Ruby 2.6.3, as described above, was:\r\n```\r\n$ rails console\r\nRunning via Spring preloader in process 22754\r\nLoading development environment (Rails 6.0.2.1)\r\n2.6.3 :001 > Book.left_outer_joins(:book_authors).merge(BookAuthor.left_outer_joins(:author).merge(Author.left_outer_joins(:name)))\r\n   (0.6ms)  SET NAMES utf8,  @@SESSION.sql_mode = CONCAT(CONCAT(@@sql_mode, ',STRICT_ALL_TABLES'), ',NO_AUTO_VALUE_ON_ZERO'),  @@SESSION.sql_auto_is_null = 0, @@SESSION.wait_timeout = 2147483\r\n  Book Load (0.8ms)  SELECT `books`.* FROM `books` LEFT OUTER JOIN `book_authors` ON `book_authors`.`book_id` = `books`.`id` LEFT OUTER JOIN `names` ON `names`.`author_id` = `authors`.`id` LEFT OUTER JOIN `authors` ON `authors`.`id` = `book_authors`.`author_id` LIMIT 11\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\nActiveRecord::StatementInvalid (Mysql2::Error: Unknown column 'authors.id' in 'on clause')\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe output for Rails 5.2.4.1 with Ruby 2.6.3, as described above, was:\r\n```\r\n$ rails console\r\nRunning via Spring preloader in process 23804\r\nLoading development environment (Rails 5.2.4.1)\r\n2.6.3 :001 > Book.left_outer_joins(:book_authors).merge(BookAuthor.left_outer_joins(:author).merge(Author.left_outer_joins(:name)))\r\n   (1.0ms)  SET NAMES utf8,  @@SESSION.sql_mode = CONCAT(CONCAT(@@sql_mode, ',STRICT_ALL_TABLES'), ',NO_AUTO_VALUE_ON_ZERO'),  @@SESSION.sql_auto_is_null = 0, @@SESSION.wait_timeout = 2147483\r\n  Book Load (1.4ms)  SELECT  `books`.* FROM `books` LEFT OUTER JOIN `book_authors` ON `book_authors`.`book_id` = `books`.`id` LEFT OUTER JOIN `authors` ON `authors`.`id` = `book_authors`.`author_id` LEFT OUTER JOIN `names` ON `names`.`author_id` = `authors`.`id` LIMIT 11\r\n => #<ActiveRecord::Relation []>\r\n```\r\n\r\nI also tested this issue on edge Rails (`c63cfc8722292ec39def505861fbc20bd9774f4c`) and got the same error.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/comments/593029332/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Auralcat","id":20464770,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNDY0Nzcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20464770?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auralcat","html_url":"https://github.com/Auralcat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auralcat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auralcat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auralcat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auralcat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auralcat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auralcat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auralcat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auralcat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Auralcat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":3331912706,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDMzMzE5MTI3MDY=","url":"https: